%%{init: {"sequence": {"actorMargin": 28, "messageMargin": 35, "mirrorActors": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Eng as Release engineer
  participant CI as GitHub Actions
  participant Reg as Image registry
  participant Ctrl as Canary controller script
  participant Stab as stable Deployment
  participant Can as canary Deployment
  participant Prom as Metrics /Prometheus
  participant Ing as Ingress / Service

  Eng->>CI: Merge release commit
  CI->>CI: tests + config gate + build
  CI->>Reg: Push checkout-api:vN+1
  CI->>Ctrl: Trigger canary rollout
  Ctrl->>Can: Deploy vN+1 at 10% weight
  Ctrl->>Ing: Split traffic 90/10
  loop Evaluate window
    Can->>Prom: scrape checkout_synthetic_error_rate
    Ctrl->>Prom: query error_rate
  end
  alt error_rate below threshold
    Ctrl->>Ing: Shift 50% → 100% to canary
    Ctrl->>Stab: Scale down old revision
    Ctrl-->>Eng: Promote success
  else error_rate exceeds threshold
    Ctrl->>Ing: Send 100% to stable
    Ctrl->>Can: Scale canary to 0 / delete
    Ctrl-->>Eng: Auto-rollback + incident note
  end
